(text "PACK-BAL-01 v0.1 - stand-alone battery-side test block, NOT a complete charger" (at 12.7 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a3c294da-449d-5704-8005-76dea731e84d"))
(text "BAT_RAW_N is cell negative BEFORE a low-side protection switch. Never equate it with USB_GND/PACK_MINUS.\nBAL_EN_N defaults OFF. External enable/OVP interfaces need battery-domain isolation/level translation." (at 12.7 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bad1c0c9-283b-502c-84ca-b33fbdd90813"))
(text "OUT is active HIGH (up to9.5V in specified conditions), not open drain. No direct FAULT_BUS_N connection.\nOVP is secondary4.30V, not a4.20V cell regulator. BQ25886+A is still incomplete.\nNo fuse/FET actuator, low-voltage enable policy, PCB, physical balancing or LW charge performed." (at 12.7 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b7fad7cc-a435-51fe-b970-8b0a70398c62"))
